---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="无MOQ制造 | 单件智能制造革命 | Geppetto" description="Geppetto打破传统制造MOQ限制，实现真正的单件制造。AI+学徒制造让小批量生产成本效益化，创新企业不再需要为MOQ妥协设计。">
  <main class="min-h-screen">
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-green-600 via-blue-600 to-purple-800 text-white py-20">
      <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 mb-6">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-r from-yellow-400 to-orange-500 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center">
                  <span class="text-2xl">🎯</span>
                </div>
                <span class="text-green-200 text-lg font-semibold">无MOQ制造革命</span>
              </div>
              
              <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold mb-6 leading-tight">
                摆脱MOQ束缚<br/>
                <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-yellow-400 to-orange-500 bg-clip-text text-transparent">单件新时代</span>
              </h1>
              
              <p class="text-2xl text-blue-100 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
                Geppetto的AI+学徒制造模式重新定义小批量生产经济学。从1件到1万件，同样精度，同样速度，革命性成本优势。
              </p>
              
              <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-8">
                <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
                  <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-yellow-300 mb-2">1件起</div>
                  <div class="text-sm text-blue-200">最低订单</div>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
                  <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-yellow-300 mb-2">工作时间</div>
                  <div class="text-sm text-blue-200">单件交付</div>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
                  <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-yellow-300 mb-2">50%↓</div>
                  <div class="text-sm text-blue-200">小批量成本</div>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
                  <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-yellow-300 mb-2">高精度</div>
                  <div class="text-sm text-blue-200">品质保证</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              
              <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
                <a href="/zh/create-quote" class="bg-gradient-to-r from-yellow-400 to-orange-500 text-purple-900 px-8 py-4 rounded-full text-lg font-bold hover:from-yellow-300 hover:to-orange-400 transform hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-300 shadow-2xl text-center">
                  🚀 立即尝试单件报价
                </a>
                <a href="#cost-model" class="border-2 border-white text-white px-6 py-4 rounded-full text-lg font-semibold hover:bg-white hover:text-purple-900 transition-all duration-300 text-center">
                  💡 了解成本模式
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="relative">
              <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-3xl p-8">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-center">🔥 无MOQ优势</h3>
                <div class="space-y-4">
                  <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                    <div class="w-3 h-3 bg-yellow-300 rounded-full"></div>
                    <span class="text-lg">零创新门槛</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                    <div class="w-3 h-3 bg-yellow-300 rounded-full"></div>
                    <span class="text-lg">最小化资本投资</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                    <div class="w-3 h-3 bg-yellow-300 rounded-full"></div>
                    <span class="text-lg">无风险市场验证</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                    <div class="w-3 h-3 bg-yellow-300 rounded-full"></div>
                    <span class="text-lg">零库存压力</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                    <div class="w-3 h-3 bg-yellow-300 rounded-full"></div>
                    <span class="text-lg">无设计妥协</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                    <div class="w-3 h-3 bg-yellow-300 rounded-full"></div>
                    <span class="text-lg">供应链独立</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Get Started -->
    <section class="py-20 bg-gradient-to-r from-green-900 to-blue-900 text-white">
      <div class="container mx-auto px-6 text-center">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-6">
          🎯 开启您的无MOQ制造之旅
        </h2>
        <p class="text-2xl text-green-100 mb-12">
          从1件开始，验证每一个想法，无需为MOQ而妥协
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-12">
          <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-xl p-6">
            <div class="text-4xl mb-4">⚡</div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">1件起订</h3>
            <p class="text-green-100 mb-3">单件制造，无MOQ限制</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-green-200">成本仅为传统制造商的50%</p>
          </div>
          
          <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-xl p-6">
            <div class="text-4xl mb-4">🚀</div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">工作时间交付</h3>
            <p class="text-green-100 mb-3">超快速响应您的需求</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-green-200">AI+学徒制造，效率革命</p>
          </div>
          
          <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-xl p-6">
            <div class="text-4xl mb-4">🎯</div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">项目定制精度</h3>
            <p class="text-green-100 mb-3">单件具有批量精度</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-green-200">零质量妥协</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 justify-center items-center">
          <a href="/zh/create-quote" class="bg-gradient-to-r from-yellow-400 to-orange-500 text-purple-900 px-12 py-4 rounded-full text-xl font-bold hover:from-yellow-300 hover:to-orange-400 transform hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-300 shadow-2xl">
            🎯 尝试单件制造
          </a>
          
          <a href="/zh/calculator" class="border-2 border-white text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-full text-lg font-semibold hover:bg-white hover:text-purple-900 transition-all duration-300">
            💰 计算制造成本
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 text-green-100">
          <p class="text-lg">
            💡 摆脱MOQ束缚，让Geppetto成为您创新路上的制造伙伴
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>